                <h1 class="text-[36px] md:text-[52px] font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[0.95]">How to Build Credit From Zero in 2026</h1>
                <p class="mt-5 text-[18px] leading-8 text-slate-600">No credit history? No problem. About 26 million Americans are credit invisible according to the CFPB. Here's exactly how to go from 0 to 700 — without an SSN myth, predatory loans, or paying interest you don't need.</p>

                <!-- Author Box -->
