                        </div>
                        <div class="mt-1 text-[13px] text-slate-600 leading-5">Reviewed by <b>Dr. James L., CFA</b> — CFA charterholder, credit risk specialist. Fact-checked against CFPB, Experian, Equifax data. <a href="/Pages/About#methodology" class="underline">Our methodology</a></div>
