                    <b class="text-amber-800">Educational content — Not financial advice.</b> No SSN required for most starter products discussed except Self (requires SSN/ITIN). ScoreUp is not a bank or bureau. Sources: CFPB, Experian, Equifax. For official guidance visit <a href="https://www.consumerfinance.gov/ask-cfpb/what-is-a-credit-score-en-315/" class="underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CFPB</a>, <a href="https://www.experian.com/blogs/ask-experian/credit-education/score-basics/what-is-a-credit-score/" class="underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Experian</a>, <a href="https://www.equifax.com/personal/education/credit-score/articles/-/learn/how-is-credit-score-calculated/" class="underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Equifax</a>.
